    "https://nscs.peopleadmin.com/postings/13541": {
      "title": "Nebraska State College System - Chadron, Peru, and Wayne State | Graduate Assistant (Theatre)",
      "description": "Nebraska State College System - Chadron, Peru, and Wayne State | Graduate Assistant (Theatre) Skip to Main Content Employment Opportunities Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Log In /Create Account Help About NSCS About CSC About PSC About WSC Graduate Assistant (Theatre) All applicants must be authorized to work in the United States without sponsorship. Applications received after interviews are scheduled may not be fully considered for this position. We do not accept references or other application materials from outside credential management organizations. Application materials and references must be submitted through our applicant tracking system. Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Job Title Graduate Assistant (Theatre) Nature of Work Graduate Assistants are hired at Chadron State College to assist in meeting the vision and goals established for CSC . Strategic deployment of graduate assistant positions is essential to ensure that limited resources are utilized in a manner consistent with the philosophy of CSC . Graduate assistants provide experiential learning in select areas and to assist the individual in a successful transition to future educational and professional opportunities. Examples of Work Performed Design one or more technical element (set, lights, costumes, props, etc.) for each production in the theatre season (typically 2-4 productions), as assigned by Theatre faculty. Attend production meetings and communicate promptly with the production’s artistic director and design team. Work with the Theatre faculty and production team to realize all technical elements. Assist in the training and supervision of students in the scene shop, costume shop, and lighting lab. Support non-theatre Memorial Hall events through safe and effective use of the Memorial Hall Auditorium and technical equipment. Assist in the planning and advertising of Theatre Day and other Theatre events. Required Qualifications Completed Bachelor’s degree Conditionally accepted or accepted application to CSC graduate program Successful background records check Work on the Chadron State College main campus Preferred Qualifications Undergraduate major or minor in Theatre or related field Experience working safely in a scene shop and installing theatrical lighting equipment Experience in scenic, lighting, and/or costume design Willingness to assist in all aspects of technical theatre Willingness to train and support undergraduate students Physical Demands License and Certification Requirements Other Requirements Salary Information $5,760 per semester plus tuition waiver (student fees not included) FTE 0 FLSA Exempt Union Status Non-Union Number of Vacancies 1 Posting Detail Information Posting Number PS1723P Desired Start Date 08/24/2026 Open Date Close Date Open Until Filled Yes Special Instructions to Applicants General Information EEO Statement The Nebraska State Colleges are equal opportunity institutions and prohibit unlawful discrimination and harassment. Each College has designated an individual to coordinate the Colleges’ non-discrimination efforts to comply with regulations implementing Title II of the Americans with Disabilities Act, Titles VI and VII of the Civil Rights Act, Title IX of the Education Amendments of 1972, the Age Discrimination Act of 1975, and Section 504 of the Rehabilitation Act. Inquiries regarding non-discrimination policies and practices may be directed to the Compliance Coordinators assigned at each College and identified on each College website. Veteran Statement This position is subject to Veterans Preference. Supplemental Questions Required fields are indicated with an asterisk (*). * Are you conditionally accepted or eligible to be accepted to a Chadron State College Master's Program? Yes No * Are you available to work on the Chadron State College campus? Yes No Documents Needed To Apply Required Documents Resume Cover Letter Transcript 1 Optional Documents Nebraska State College System Student Employment at CSC Student Employment at PSC Student Employment at WSC Chadron State College Peru State College Wayne State College To ensure the security of your data, you will be logged out due to inactivity in 3 minutes at . Any data not saved will be lost. Click 'OK' to keep your session active."
